<p class=tx><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>                        Charitable
organizations, minimum charge         $28.25 per entry</span></p>

<p class=tx><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              2. 
Deposit of source-separated yard waste, clean wood waste, or any combination
thereof:</span></p>

<p class=tx><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>                        Fixed-rate
vehicles                                                  $20.70 per entry</span></p>

<p class=tx><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>                        Per-ton-rate
vehicles                                               $129.38 per ton</span></p>

<p class=tx><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>                        Minimum
charge                                                      $20.70 per vehicle</span></p>

<p class=tx><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              3. 
Deposit of major appliances:</span></p>

<p class=tx><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>                        Major
appliances with refrigerants                        $30.00 per unit</span></p>

<p class=tx><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              4. 
Deposit of mattresses:</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>                        </span><span
style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>Mattresses</span><span
style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>                                                                 $30.00
per unit; and</span></p>

<p class=tx><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              5.  Qualified
low-income customers shall receive fee discounts of $20.00 per entry for
deposit of solid waste, yard waste, clean wood waste appliances and mattresses. 
Customers with mixed loads must separate and deposit materials with sequential
visits to the scale house to receive a discount on the individual waste types.</span></p>

<p class=tx><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>        B.</span>  <span
style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>Each billing entity in the solid waste
system will pay a share of the fixed-annual charge.  The share each billing
entity pays, for each service area it serves, is directly proportional to the
total tons of municipal solid waste deposited by solid waste collection
entities at county-operated solid waste facilities in the most recent calendar
year for which data is available, as shown in the following formula:</span></p>

<p class=tx><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>          1.  W = X *
(Y / Z), where:</span></p>

<p class=tx><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>            a.  W is
the billing entity's share in dollars of the fixed-annual charge for a specific
service area;</span></p>

<p class=tx><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>            b.  X is
the total amount of the fixed-annual charge for the calendar year;</span></p>

<p class=tx><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>            c.  Y is
the number of tons of municipal solid waste from a specific service area of the
billing entity that is deposited at county-operated solid waste facilities in
the most recent calendar year for which data is available; and</span></p>

<p class=tx><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>            d.  Z is
the total number of tons of municipal solid waste from all service areas
deposited at county-operated solid waste facilities by all solid waste
collection entities in the most recent calendar year for which data is
available, excluding regional direct tons.</span></p>

<p class=tx><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>          2. 
Beginning January 1, 2026, the fixed-annual charge is $26,838,510.</span></p>

<p class=tx><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>            C.  Fees
for the use of solid waste facilities without scales shall be based upon the
cubic yard or fraction thereof as follows:</span></p>

<p class=tx><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              1. 
Solid waste disposal:</span></p>

<p class=tx><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>                        Fixed-rate
vehicles                                                  $36.69 per entry</span></p>

<p class=tx><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>                        Per-ton-rate
vehicles:</span></p>

<p class=tx><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>                        Compacted
wastes                                                  $66.49 per cubic yard</span></p>

<p class=tx><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>                        Uncompacted
wastes                                              $38.98 per cubic yard</span></p>

<p class=tx><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>                        Minimum
