wastes                                              $21.99 per cubic yard</span></p>

<p class=tx><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>                        Minimum
charge                                                      $20.70 per vehicle</span></p>

<p class=tx><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              3. 
Qualified low-income customers shall receive fee discounts of $20.00 per entry
for deposit of solid waste, yard waste, clean wood waste , appliances and
