<p class=tx><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>            D.  Fees
at the Cedar Hills regional landfill shall be:</span></p>

<p class=tx><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>                        Cedar
Hills Regional Direct                                    $194.89 per ton</span></p>

