<p class=tx><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>                        Per-ton-rate
vehicles                                               $140.50 per ton</span></p>

<p class=tx><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>                        Minimum
charge                                                      $22.50 per vehicle</span></p>

<p class=tx><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              3. 
